    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "8:35 PM",
      "text": "Your piece was fine, but as an FYI the verhagen note was not why the policy was implemented."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "I call it like I see it"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Your sight is wrong"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Are my sources, too?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "8:38 PM",
      "text": "As a source close to the situation, I can say that they are most definitely wrong"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:38 PM",
      "text": "Weird"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:39 PM",
      "text": "Cuz a source higher than you says I’m right"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:39 PM",
      "text": "And he’s sitting next to me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:39 PM",
      "text": "😂"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ben Fidelman",
      "time": "8:39 PM",
      "text": "Perhaps it was a contributing factor, but definitely not the root cause"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:39 PM",
      "text": "There’s the backtracking"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:39 PM",
      "text": "Goodnight"
    }
  ]
